WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.000
Hello, I'm Edna Stern from Kfar Saba.

2
00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:09.800
I came to this clinic after seeing a small ad.

3
00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:13.600
I had a knee replacement,

4
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:20.400
and for five years I was in agony. I couldn't walk, I couldn't sleep.

5
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.500
I had very hard days and terrible suffering.

6
00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:27.200
I came to the clinic, and honestly,

7
00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:34.400
I was very skeptical about the needle treatment, because I'd had needle treatment at Loewenstein,

8
00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:38.300
and after three treatments I fainted, so the doctor told me:

9
00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:41.600
"Ma'am, needle treatments aren't for you."

10
00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:49.400
I came to Noam and explained my situation. I told him, I'm very sensitive, I'm scared.

11
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:54.200
By the second treatment I already felt relief,

12
00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:56.400
I could already sleep at night.

13
00:00:56.800 --> 00:00:59.600
Not that my nights were quiet,

14
00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:02.700
but with the electromagnetic treatment

15
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:06.300
I could feel it working hard,

16
00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:12.100
and I don't know, it really works.

17
00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:15.200
The third treatment, with the electromagnetic device,

18
00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:16.900
was amazing.

19
00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:20.700
I told Noam today, I said, Noam,

20
00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:24.100
I can feel how hard this device works.

21
00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:26.200
This device works wonders for me.

22
00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:30.000
Today, thank God, I rely less on my walking stick.

23
00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:31.500
It's in my bag,

24
00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:36.300
but getting here to Noam without the stick is a huge achievement.

25
00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:37.200
Thank you very much.
